Grammar

Rule 0     S' -> document
Rule 1     document -> content
Rule 2     element -> LT ID attributes GT content LTSLASH ID GT
Rule 3     element -> TEXT
Rule 4     attributes -> attributes attribute
Rule 5     attributes -> empty
Rule 6     attribute -> ID EQUALS STRING
Rule 7     content -> content element
Rule 8     content -> empty
Rule 9     empty -> <empty>

Terminals, with rules where they appear

EQUALS               : 6
GT                   : 2 2
ID                   : 2 2 6
LT                   : 2
LTSLASH              : 2
STRING               : 6
TEXT                 : 3
error                : 

Nonterminals, with rules where they appear

attribute            : 4
attributes           : 2 4
content              : 1 2 7
document             : 0
element              : 7
empty                : 5 8

